{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPERIENCE THE SPEED AT A CRAZY FESTIVAL!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STUNSTEVAL SIDEROLLERS</strong> is an arcade race with a side view. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try to outrun a helicopter, a biplane or a fighter jet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive in the rain or on a dark highway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose the appearance of your character. <br>Rent new cars and customize his style to suit yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360830/extras/style.gif?t=1739633141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are three main types of races in the <strong>first season</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Checkpoint</strong><i> - you need to manage to pass all the checkpoints in a certain time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360830/extras/checkpoint.gif?t=1739633141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Destruction</strong><i> - destroy as many walls as possible in a short time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360830/extras/destruction.gif?t=1739633141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drag Racing</strong> <i>- is to drive a certain distance in a limited time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360830/extras/drag.gif?t=1739633141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your main goal is to get to the grand race and win it!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3360830?t=1739633141","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3360830?t=1739633141","capsule_image":"https://sha